| *Motherboard*     | ASRock J3455B-ITX                                            | A good enough CPU/motherboard combo                                         |
| PCIe 2.0 x16 (x2) | 8-Port HBA (LSI SAS9211-8I)                                  | Eight more SATA ports                                                       |
| USB 2.0 Header    | 2x USB splitters to 4x USB-to-SATA adapters                  | Four more SATA ports                                                        |
| *CPU*             | Intel Celeron J3455                                          |                                                                             |
