| *Fans*            | • Exhaust: 120mm (Noctua NF-S12A) `<br>`{=html} • Side panel: 2x 120mm (Noctua NF-F12 iPPC) | F12 for static pressure and S12A for airflow |
| *UPS*             | 750VA (APC ES-750)                                           | Protection from occasional power outages                                    |

### Remote Server

Similar to the reasons above, I wanted the remote backup to be handled
automatically, rather than me manually syncing a drive or two, so it's also a
server now. It's smaller than the main server, so only a subset of my data can
be backed up here.

