| PCIe 3.0 x16 (x16) | 4-Port NVMe to PCIe Card (10Gtek S95N416-0)                  | Similar redundancy to the data vdev `<br>`{=html} Configured x4x4x8 due to poor PCIe bifurcation |
| PCIe 3.0 x16 (x4)  | 8-Port HBA (LSI SAS9211-8I)                                  |                                                                         |
