### Flash Server

A flash server to allow for fast, reasonably sized storage in a compact space.
I went with the asustor FS6706T for its six NVMe bays in a small form factor,
allowing it to provide high speed access while hiding away in a closet. If I
had to do it again, I'd have chosen the twelve bay model and used 4TB drives.
With two drives lost to redundancy and one lost to the OS, only half the bays
are usable.

